ed version to confirm all improvements are in place"}"}}]},{"role":"tool","name":"read_file","tool_call_id":"toolu_01NFvCMMCF6zqHg9Fen9cABL","content":"Contents of app/src/main/java/com/vlad/simion/minderaassignment/ui/repositories/RepositoriesListViewModel.kt:
